source.bookSourceComment:
by天天的鸟蛋蛋
by = =       
参考by一包薯条 给的 不能直接用
虽然没啥用，当个示例吧
@css:#chapter-list > dd[id]
<js>
let content = result
let indices = [];
for (i in result) {
  let match = String(result[i]).match(/c(.*)?"/);
  indices.push(Number(match[1])-1);
}
for (i in result){	result[i]=content[indices.indexOf(parseInt(i))]
};
result
</js>
目录乱序参考木叶小说网
https://ysqbbs.com/thread-15279-1-1.html

